timestamp=2026-11-14T07:08:22.276Z level=INFO run=895237dc message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\nimport json, math\nd = json.load(open(\"/tmp/opencode/waypoints_polished.json\"))\nw0, w1 = d[\"waypoints\"][0], d[\"waypoints\"][1]\nprint(\"w0:\", w0)\nprint(\"w1:\", w1)\ndx, dy, dz = [w1[\"pos\"][i] - w0[\"pos\"][i] for i in range(3)]\n# Since w0 quat = [1,0,0,0], dq = w1[\"quat\"]!\nqw, qx, qy, qz = w1[\"quat\"]\nth = 2.0 * math.acos(min(1.0, abs(qw)))\ns = math.sqrt(max(1e-16, 1.0 - qw*qw))\nrx, ry, rz = qx/s*th, qy/s*th, qz/s*th\nprint(f\"dx={dx:.6f}, dy={dy:.6f}, dz={dz:.6f} (norm={math.hypot(dx,dy,dz):.5f})\")\nprint(f\"axis-angle: droll={rx:.6f}, dpitch={ry:.6f}, dyaw={rz:.6f} (norm={th:.5f})\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
